                 :R8xx0dhbEh1tjGMDwNZfckV "material containing one or more of the following: plutonium except that with isotopic concentration exceeding 80 % in 238Pu; uranium enriched in the isotope 235 or 233; uranium containing the mixture of isotopes as occurring in nature other than in the form of ore or ore residue" ;
                 :referenceISO <https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/en/#iso:std:iso:12749:-3:ed-2:v1:en:term:3.1.1> ;
                 :referenceNSSG <https://vocabulary.iaea.org/iaea-safety-glossary/1355.html> .


